; xdremux.app -> GitHub Pages
; Import at: Cloudflare Dashboard -> xdremux.app -> DNS -> Records -> Import and Export -> Import
; Keep every record DNS-only (grey cloud): GitHub Pages must be able to answer the
; ACME HTTP challenge itself, otherwise HTTPS certificate issuance fails.
; Reference: https://docs.github.com/en/pages/configuring-a-custom-domain-for-your-github-pages-site
; GitHub Pages IPs are stable; re-check the docs page above if GitHub ever changes them.

xdremux.app.        300 IN A     185.199.108.153
xdremux.app.        300 IN A     185.199.109.153
xdremux.app.        300 IN A     185.199.110.153
xdremux.app.        300 IN A     185.199.111.153

xdremux.app.        300 IN AAAA  2606:50c0:8000::153
xdremux.app.        300 IN AAAA  2606:50c0:8001::153
xdremux.app.        300 IN AAAA  2606:50c0:8002::153
xdremux.app.        300 IN AAAA  2606:50c0:8003::153

www.xdremux.app.    300 IN CNAME beetman.github.io.
